This is the first task of a 15-task plan to build a spare parts (备品备件) management system. This task creates the entire project foundation. All subsequent tasks depend on this one being correct.

The project is at: `/Users/felix/code/.claude/worktrees/beijian+spare-parts-management/beijian/`

There is already a `docs/` directory with design files (don't touch these).

